    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d439-a1">

                <pb facs="0615" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg519"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 31—Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Acting British consul-general to United States
                        minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tabriz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-11"><hi rendition="#italic">April 11,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1.]</seg></opener>
                <p>I have received information from Salmas that by order of Emir-i-Nizam, Mihran
                    Bagdasarian, American citizen, has been unjustly imprisoned. I have demanded his
                    immediate release, and protested against this action. Please have orders
                    telegraphed to Emir-i-Nizam to cease molesting American citizens.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
